Q: How to reverse the order of element&#39;s children? A: <p>The following code works for me:</p>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-css lang-css prettyprint-override"><code>.wrapper {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column-reverse;
}</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;div class="wrapper"&gt;
  &lt;div class="main"&gt;top&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="footer"&gt;bottom&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>
